"he_deathwarden","Death Warden Dwarf","A success on a save against a void effect, or an effect an undead creates, is a critical success.","Forge Dwarf","Fire resistance equal to half your level (at least 1).","he_rock","Rock Dwarf","+2 to saves against being knocked prone. (Its bonus against Trip, Shove and forced movement has nothing to act on here.)","Strong-Blooded Dwarf","Poison resistance equal to half your level (at least 1). (Its faster recovery from poison stages isn\'t modelled.)","he_ancientblood",
