"he_gutsy","Gutsy Halfling","A success on a save against an emotion effect is a critical success (with Irrepressible, a critical failure is a failure).","he_hillock","Hillock Halfling","More HP from rest and from Treat Wounds with a snack.","he_nomadic","Nomadic Halfling","Two extra languages.","Twilight Halfling","Low-light vision.","he_wildwood","Wildwood Halfling","Ignore difficult terrain from plants and fungi.","he_jinxed","Jinxed Halfling","No Halfling Luck. Jinx (2 actions, once per day): a foe\'s Will save against your class or spell DC; failure clumsy 1 for 1 minute, critical failure clumsy 2.",
"an_luck","Charhide Goblin","Fire resistance equal to half your level (at least 1); the flat check to end persistent fire is DC 10.","he_irongut","Irongut Goblin","Eat spoiled food; +2 against ingested afflictions.","Snow Goblin","he_badlands","Badlands Orc","Hustle twice as long; heat is one step less extreme.","Battle-Ready Orc","Trained in Intimidation (Demoralize) and Intimidating Glare.","he_deep","Deep Orc","Terrain Expertise (underground) and Combat Climber.","Grave Orc","Void resistance equal to half your level (at least 1); +1 to saves against death and void effects.",
"Hold-Scarred Orc","12 Hit Points from your ancestry instead of 10, and Diehard (you die at dying 5 instead of 4).","he_rainfall","Rainfall Orc","+2 to Climb and Swim; +1 to saves against disease.","Winter Orc","Trained in Survival (the Trackless Marsh); cold is one step less extreme.","he_hunting","Hunting Catfolk","Imprecise scent 30 feet; +2 to Track.","he_jungle","Jungle Catfolk","Ignore difficult terrain from undergrowth.","he_liminal","Liminal Catfolk","Detect magic as an occult innate cantrip.","Nine Lives Catfolk",
"Recovery checks are DC 10 whatever your dying value, and Diehard (you die at dying 5 instead of 4).","he_sharpeared","Sharp-Eared Catfolk","+2 to Seek undetected creatures you can hear; Point Out by sound.","Winter Catfolk","Aiuvarin","elven blood. The elf trait and low-light vision; you can take elf ancestry feats too.","Dromaar","orc blood. The orc trait and low-light vision; you can take orc ancestry feats too.","he_dragonblood","Dragonblood","a dragon among your forebears. A success on a save against fear is a critical success.",
