"retch","Retch","While sickened: spend an action retching. A Fortitude save against the effect\'s DC lowers Sickened by 1 (by 2 on a critical success).","Avert Gaze","Look away from a gaze: a +2 circumstance bonus to saves against visual effects (a medusa\'s petrifying gaze, a basilisk\'s) until the start of your next turn.","Demoralize","Intimidation vs Will DC. Success: frightened 1 (critical: 2). Whatever the result, the target is then immune to your Demoralize for the rest of the battle.","trip","Trip",
"Athletics vs Reflex DC against a front-line enemy no more than one size larger (two with Titan Wrestler). Success: knocked prone (off-guard, -2 to attacks); critical success: also 1d6 bludgeoning. Critical failure: you fall prone.","Diplomacy against a foe\'s Will DC: −2 status penalty to its Perception and Will saves for 1 minute (−3 on a critical success). Critical failure: you take the −2 yourself.","Diplomacy against a foe\'s Will DC: stupefied 1 for 1 round (stupefied 2 on a critical success): a penalty to its spells, Will saves and mental checks, and a flat check to cast at all. Once per foe per fight.",
"Attack. Thievery against the Reflex DC of a foe in melee reach. Success: clumsy 1 for 1 round. Critical success: clumsy 1 until it spends an action to fix it. Critical failure: you fall prone.","Diplomacy against the Will DC of each frightened ally next to you (and yourself): frightened falls by 1, or 2 on a critical success. Each once per fight.","Occultism against a foe\'s Will DC (every foe if you\'re legendary): frightened 1; critical success: also confused for 1 round. Critical failure: you\'re frightened 1. Once per foe per fight.",
"Incapacitation. Intimidation against a living foe\'s Will DC. Critical success: it attempts a Fortitude save against your Intimidation DC and dies on a critical failure, otherwise frightened 2 and fleeing for 1 round. Success: frightened 2. Failure: frightened 1. Once per foe per fight.","grapple","Grapple","Attack, 1 action. Athletics vs Fortitude DC against a front-line enemy no more than one size larger (two with Titan Wrestler). Success: grabbed (off-guard, can\'t move); critical success: restrained (off-guard, can\'t move or attack, only try to Escape), until the end of your next turn, or until you move or it Escapes. Failure: a hold you had ends. Critical failure: a hold you had ends and you fall prone. While you hold a foe you can\'t raise a shield or use your other hand\'s weapon.",
"feint","Feint","Deception vs Perception DC. Success: the enemy is off-guard (-2 AC, sneak attack bait). Critical failure: you are off-guard until the end of your next turn.","Recall Knowledge","Learn an enemy\'s AC, saves, resistances and weaknesses.","medicine","Battle Medicine","Medicine check to heal an ally: DC 15 for 2d8 HP (expert DC 20: +10, master DC 30: +30, legendary DC 40: +50; double dice on a critical success, 1d8 damage on a critical failure). You can treat each ally (yourself included) once per encounter.",
"Raise Shield","+2 circumstance bonus to AC until your next turn. While it\'s raised you can Shield Block (reaction: Hardness 5 off physical damage).","+2 circumstance bonus to AC until your next turn. While it\'s raised you can Shield Block (reaction).","Vicious Swing","Sword & Board|Two-Hander|Duelist|Dual Weapons|Polearm","Flourish. A melee Strike that counts as two attacks for your multiple attack penalty; a hit deals one extra weapon die (two at 10th level, three at 18th).","Sudden Charge","Flourish. Stride twice and Strike: reach any enemy, whatever its row.",
"Exacting Strike","Press. A Strike that doesn\'t count toward your multiple attack penalty if it misses (but not on a critical miss).","Dueling Parry","Parry with your one-handed weapon and free hand: +2 circumstance bonus to AC until your next turn.","Intimidating Strike","A melee Strike. On a hit the target is frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical hit).","Knockdown","Flourish. A melee Strike; if it hits, Trip the target with Athletics. Both use your current multiple attack penalty.","Dual-Handed Assault",
"Flourish. Grip your weapon with both hands for one Strike: its damage die is one size larger.","Double Shot","Flourish. Two Strikes against two different targets, each at -2. Both use your current multiple attack penalty.","Debilitating Shot","Flourish. A ranged Strike. On a hit the target is slowed 1 until the end of its next turn.","Whirlwind Strike","Flourish. A melee Strike against every enemy in reach (the front line), all at your current multiple attack penalty.","Impossible Volley","Flourish. A Strike at -2 against every enemy in a burst; damage is rolled once.",
"ch_lay","Lay on Hands","Devotion spell, 1 action. Heal 6 HP per spell rank; an ally other than you also gains +2 status bonus to AC for 1 round.","Shields of the Spirit","Devotion spell, 1 action. Raise your Shield; allies in your aura gain +1 status bonus to AC and enemies that attack them take 1d4 spirit damage (+1d4 every 2 ranks).","cl_fire","Fire Ray","Cloistered Cleric","Domain spell (fire). Spell attack for 2d6 fire per rank; unless you critically miss, the ground under the target burns for 1d6 fire per rank at the end of its next turn, unless it moves away first.",
"wz_bolt","Force Bolt","School spell, 1 action. Never misses: 1d4+1 force, +1d4+1 every 2 ranks.","wz_wards","School spell, 1 action. You and your allies gain +1 status bonus to AC while you Sustain it (1 action each turn).","wz_sustain","Sustain Protective Wards","1 action. Keep your protective wards up until the end of your next turn.","wz_push","School spell, 1 action, incapacitation. Will save: success -1 to its attacks and damage against you; failure it can\'t attack you until your next turn; critical failure also stunned 1.",
