"so_jaws","Glutton\'s Jaws","Bloodline spell. Spell attack for 2d6 piercing per rank; a hit gives you 1d4 temporary HP per rank.","so_toss","Elemental Toss","Bloodline spell, 1 action. Spell attack: 1d8 bludgeoning (earth) per rank.","ba_courage","Courageous Anthem","Composition cantrip, 1 action, 1 round. You and your allies gain +1 status bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls and saves against fear.","Composition cantrip, 1 action, 1 round. +1 status bonus to AC and saves, and resistance to physical damage equal to half the rank.",
"Composition cantrip, 1 action, 1 round. Enemies are frightened 1 and can\'t lower it below 1 while the dirge lasts.","ba_linger","Lingering Composition","Free action, spellshape. Performance check: your next composition lasts 3 rounds (4 on a critical success). On a failure it lasts 1 round and the Focus Point isn\'t spent.","Fortissimo Composition","Free action, spellshape. Performance check: your next anthem\'s bonus becomes +2 (+3 on a critical success). On a failure it stays +1 and the Focus Point isn\'t spent.",
"ra_prey","Hunt Prey","Prey","1 action. Mark an enemy as your prey. Your hunter\'s edge applies against it.","Hunted Shot","Flourish, 1 action. Two Strikes against your prey; the multiple attack penalty applies normally.","Twin Takedown","Flourish, 1 action. A Strike against your prey with your weapon, then one with the agile weapon in your other hand (if the prey is in its reach); the multiple attack penalty applies normally.","Crossbow Ace","1 action. Take Cover and reload your crossbow: +2 AC (standard cover) if an ally already gave you cover, +1 if not, until you attack or move.",
"Reload","1 action (Interact). Load your weapon. A loaded weapon with reload fires once, then needs reloading; a Strike with it unloaded costs the extra action to reload first.","Hunter\'s Aim","2 actions. A ranged Strike against your prey with +2 circumstance bonus to hit.","Penetrating Shot","2 actions. One ranged Strike against a creature and your prey behind it; damage is rolled once. Counts as two attacks.","Twin Feint","Strike twice. The target is off-guard to your second Strike (sneak attack!).","Swipe",
"Flourish, 2 actions. One melee Strike against a foe and another beside it in reach (picked for you): one attack roll against both ACs, damage rolled once. Counts as two attacks.","Incredible Aim","2 actions, concentrate. A ranged Strike with a +2 circumstance bonus to hit.","Certain Strike","Press. A Strike; a failure (not a critical failure) still deals the Strike\'s damage without its dice.","Brutal Finish","Press. A melee Strike with one extra weapon die (two at 18th); even a failure deals one weapon die. Then your turn ends.",
"Defensive Advance","Flourish, 2 actions. Raise your Shield (+2 AC until your next turn, Shield Block ready), then make a melee Strike.","Lay on Hands (Mercy)","Devotion spell, 2 actions (Mercy, 4th). Lay on Hands that also ends a condition on the ally: frightened, sickened, enfeebled, clumsy or fleeing; from 8th (Greater Mercy) also slowed, blinded, drained, confused, grabbed or paralyzed. (The rules counteract it; here it simply ends.)","Smite","1 action. Designate an enemy: your Strikes against it gain a +3 status bonus to damage (+4 from 13th) for the rest of the fight, or until you designate another.",
"Deadly Aim","Flourish. A ranged Strike against your prey at -2 to hit, dealing +4 damage (+6 at 11th, +8 at 15th).","Twist the Knife","1 action, right after a melee sneak attack this turn. The creature you sneak attacked takes persistent bleed damage equal to your sneak attack dice.","Focus spell, 2 actions. An ally gains fast healing 2 per rank (it regains that much HP at the start of each of its turns) for 4 rounds, and as many temporary HP. (You would Sustain it each round; here it simply lasts.)","Allegro",
"Composition cantrip, 1 action. An ally other than you is quickened on its next turn: one extra action, to Strike or Move.","Soothing Ballad","Composition focus spell, 2 actions. You and your allies regain 7d8 HP (+1d8 per rank above 7th).","Fatal Aria","Composition focus spell, 1 action, death. A creature of 16th level or lower dies; a 17th-level one dies if it has 50 HP or fewer, otherwise drops to 0 HP; 18th or higher takes 50 sonic damage. Then it is immune to the aria for the rest of the fight.","Dragon Breath",
"Bloodline spell (Advanced Bloodline, 6th). A 30-foot cone of your dragon\'s breath: 5d6 force at rank 3, +2d6 per rank above, basic Reflex.","Bloodline spell (Greater Bloodline, 10th), 1 action. Brand an enemy: you and your allies gain +1 to attack rolls against it until the start of your next turn.","Elemental Blast","Bloodline spell (Greater Bloodline, 10th). A burst of your element (earth): 8d6 bludgeoning at rank 5, +2d6 per rank above, basic Reflex.","Spiral of Horrors","School spell (Advanced School Spell, 8th). Every enemy is frightened 1 and can\'t lower it below 1 for 3 rounds. (You would Sustain it; here it simply lasts.)",
"Divine Disharmony","1 action. Intimidation or Deception (the better) against the creature\'s Will DC. Success: it is off-guard until the end of your turn; critical success: until the end of your next turn.","Root to Life","1 action. A dying ally beside you stops dying: it stays unconscious at 0 HP (and gains Wounded as usual), so it can\'t die from its recovery checks.","Widen Spell","1 action, spellshape. If your next action is to cast a spell with a burst or a cone, it covers more: a burst also reaches the slots diagonal to its centre, a cone also the slots beside the first one it hits.",
