"ki_blast1_","Impulse, 1 action. Impulse attack against AC for "," (whichever does more to the target); one more die at 5th, 9th, 13th and 17th level."," Weapon Infusion: bludgeoning, piercing or slashing instead when that does more. Melee (adds your Strength modifier) at a creature in the enemy\'s nearest row, ranged at one behind it (a ranged attack within a creature\'s reach can draw a Reactive Strike).","ki_blast2_","Elemental Blast (2 actions)","Impulse, 2 actions. As the 1-action blast, plus a status bonus to damage equal to your Constitution modifier.",
"ki_extract_","Extract Element","Impulse, 1 action, 3rd level. A creature with the "," trait: 2d4 damage (+1d4 at 5th, 7th, 9th and every 2 levels), basic Fortitude save. Unless it critically succeeds, until your kinetic aura ends (an overflow impulse): against your impulses its immunity to "," becomes resistance equal to its level, its other resistances are ignored, and it takes a -1 penalty to AC and saves. You can\'t extract it again meanwhile.","ki_boomer","Aerial Boomerang","A boomerang of air down a 60-foot line (the target\'s row): 2d4 slashing, basic Reflex, +1d4 every 2 levels. (Its hover and return are not modelled.)",
"ki_dash","Lightning Dash","Overflow. You become lightning and streak along a 30-foot line (the target\'s row): 2d12 electricity, basic Reflex, +1d12 every 3 levels.","ki_tremor","Tremor","Overflow. The ground heaves in a 10-foot burst: 1d8 bludgeoning, basic Fortitude, +1d8 every 2 levels; knocked prone on a critical failure.","ki_wstone","Weight of Stone","Overflow. A column of crushing weight: 4d8 bludgeoning, basic Reflex, +1d8 every 2 levels.","ki_mountain","The Shattered Mountain Weeps","Overflow. A 20-foot burst of falling stone: 9d10 bludgeoning (10d10 at 20th), basic Fortitude; knocked prone on a failure.",
