"th_sip","Drink from the Chalice (sip)","1 action, once per round. An ally gains temporary HP equal to your level (minimum 3) until the end of your next turn.","th_drain","Drink from the Chalice (drain)","1 action, once per battle. An ally heals 3 HP per level.","bb_rage","Rage","1 action, while not raging or fatigued. Temporary HP equal to your level + Constitution (none if a rage ended less than 1 minute ago), extra damage on melee and thrown Strikes, no concentrate actions without the rage trait. Lasts 1 minute; you can\'t stop it. You start every fight raging (Quick-Tempered).",
"Furious Finish","Rage, 1 action. A Strike; on a hit, a circumstance bonus to damage equal to the rounds left in your rage (up to 10). Then your rage ends and you are fatigued (-1 AC and saves) for the rest of the fight: no more rage.","Shake It Off","Rage, 1 action. Frightened drops by 1, and a Fortitude save against the sickness: sickened drops by 1 on a failure, 2 on a success, 3 on a critical success.","Dragon\'s Rage Breath","Rage, 2 actions, once per fight (once per 10 minutes). A 30-foot cone of fire: 1d6 fire per level, basic Reflex save against your class DC.",
