"s_pain","Phantom Pain","Illusory agony: 2d4 mental damage, Will save. Success: the damage only. Failure: also 1d4 persistent mental damage and sickened 1 (2 on a critical failure); the pain ends when the sickness does. +2d4 and +1d4 persistent per rank.","s_blazing","Blazing Bolt","Two rays of fire at up to two different foes: a spell attack against each for 4d6 fire, +2d6 per rank above 2nd. The multiple attack penalty rises after both.","Acid Grip","A taloned hand of acid: 2d8 acid damage, basic Reflex save; on a failure also 1d6 persistent acid damage per 2 ranks (doubled on a critical failure). +2d8 every 2 ranks.",
"Noise Blast","A cacophonous burst: 2d10 sonic damage, basic Fortitude save; stunned 1 on a critical failure. +1d10 per rank.","s_spirit","Spiritual Armament","A ghostly echo of your weapon flies at a foe: spell attack for 2d8 spirit damage, +1d8 every 2 ranks.","Your form blurs: concealed for 1 minute. Anyone attacking you must succeed at a DC 5 flat check or miss.","Fireball","Burst of fire, basic Reflex save.","Lightning Bolt","A bolt through a whole row, basic Reflex save.","Haste","An ally is quickened for 1 minute: one extra action each turn that can only be used to Strike or Move.",
"Paralyze","Will save. Success: stunned 1. Failure: paralyzed for 1 round. Critical failure: paralyzed for 4 rounds (a new Will save at the end of each of its turns shortens it). Incapacitation.","Slow","Fortitude save. Success: slowed 1 for 1 round. Failure: slowed 1 for 1 minute. Critical failure: slowed 2 for 1 minute.","s_heroism","Heroism","An ally gains +1 to attacks and saves for 5 rounds.","Holy Light","A ray of holy light: spell attack for 5d6 fire damage, plus 5d6 spirit damage against unholy creatures. +2d6 each per rank.",
