"Howling Blizzard","Freezing winds: 10d6 cold damage in a cone, basic Reflex save. +2d6 per rank.","s_pulse","Synaptic Pulse","A psychic pulse hits every enemy: Will save. Success: stunned 1. Failure: stunned 2. Critical failure: stunned for 1 round (it loses its whole turn). Incapacitation.","Disintegrate","Spell attack; on a hit the target takes 12d10 untyped damage with a basic Fortitude save (one degree worse on a critical hit). +2d10 per rank.","Chain Lightning","Lightning leaps between foes, basic Reflex save.",
